# @hub-lanes

# ── ORGO LIVE STATE (BH-5750, part of #5744) ────────────────────────────────
# Every 5 minutes: for each Orgo account in catalog/orgo-plans.json, read
# GET /computers and PUT the list to the jobs worker (orgo_computers), which
# the /machines ORGO STATE column reads. A complete list tombstones a computer
# that is gone; a failed or capped read tombstones nothing. An account with no
# API key is one log line, never an alert. Hub only: the hub holds the Orgo
# keys. Knob: ORGO_STATE_CALL_TIMEOUT_S in catalog/lanes.d/orgo-state.json.
# Off via the lane's flags/lane-off-<id> flag (bin/harness-ctl.sh off <id>).
*/5 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/orgo-state.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
